     2	// THE PRE-MUTATION JAIL: an Antigravity PreToolUse hook (registered in <control_dir>/.agents/hooks.json through the
     3	// per-unit wrapper <control_dir>/pantheon-jail-hook, which runs `node jail-hook.mjs <jail.json>`).
