     5	// Reads the hook input JSON on stdin (documented fields: toolCall.name, toolCall.args — e.g. TargetFile, CommandLine,
     6	// Cwd — stepIdx, conversationId, workspacePaths, transcriptPath, modelName; a few other plausible spellings of the
     7	// name/args are read too, see toolCallOf) and prints EXACTLY ONE decision line on stdout, then exits 0.
