    19	//       the target is the FIRST PRESENT of args.Path, args.TargetFile, args.AbsolutePath, args.File (WRITE_PATH_KEYS;
    20	//       OBSERVED on agy 1.5.10, owner's machine, 2026-11-18: the real write tool is `write_file` with args {Path,
    21	//       Content}, emitted although the card listed write_to_file; the hook denied it as an unknown tool, so the owned
    22	//       write was blocked too and the forbidden-write deny proved nothing about the owned-path policy). auto_approve
    23	//       ONLY when that target is an absolute path that, resolved WITHOUT following a final symlink and with every
    24	//       intermediate symlink resolved, stays inside the worktree, is not inside .git or .agents, and is matched by the
    25	//       unit's owned_paths (pipeline/paths.mjs matchesOwned) both as written and as resolved; else deny.
    26	//   run_command
    27	//       auto_approve ONLY when args.CommandLine (trimmed) equals the unit's WORKER verify command exactly -- the policy's
    28	//       worker_verify_cmd, i.e. workerVerifyCommand(worktree, verify_cmd) = `cd '<worktree>' && <verify_cmd>` -- and
